                                                "example_id": "0be6276a-4aa1-4c82-a8f3-405a47532f5a",
                                                "sense_id": "90ec0eaa-063c-30e8-9d00-6e798bfb11e8",
                                                "text": "Lastly, Because I would take away all occasions which men might have to incur the danger of the penalty allowed by the Parliament by hindring them so to doe, at least untill I could so provide for my selfe, as that I need not to be extreamly rigorous against any, but such as shall contumeliously affront the Authority of my grant."
